# app themes over the style (ui/theme.rs, theme_app.rs; docs/STYLES.md "App themes"): the
# two sample themes of apps/themedemo and a theme with a font family from files, in light /
# dark / high contrast.  Every expectation holds in every style (build_rs.py app gallery
# --style classic|kde): the theme sets the values.  Back to the style's own look gives the
# same pixels; a broken file names its line and keeps the theme.
theme light
# (selection pills slide to their place in the first frames)
wait 500
expect theme none
shot build/gal_themes/default.png
# ---- Ozean: colours, 36 DIP controls, 110 % spacing
theme file apps/themedemo/assets/themes/ocean.theme
expect theme error none
expect theme "Ozean"
expect token bg #EAF3F5
expect token text #0B2A33
expect token card #FFFFFF
expect #100 rect * * * 36
expect #101 rect * * * 36
expect #8701 rect * * * 36
expect #8702 rect * * 120 36
shot build/gal_themes/ocean_light.png
theme dark
expect token bg #0E1E24
expect token text #E6F4F7
shot build/gal_themes/ocean_dark.png
theme contrast
expect token accent #00E5FF
shot build/gal_themes/ocean_hc.png
theme light
# ---- Papier: square corners, 28 DIP controls, 90 % spacing
theme file apps/themedemo/assets/themes/paper.theme
expect theme "Papier"
expect token bg #F5F1E8
expect token crit #B3261E
expect #100 rect * * * 28
expect #8701 rect * * * 28
shot build/gal_themes/paper_light.png
theme dark
expect token bg #24201B
expect token crit #B3261E
shot build/gal_themes/paper_dark.png
theme contrast
shot build/gal_themes/paper_hc.png
theme light
# ---- a font family from files (Inter of styles/jfoffice) at 14 DIP: the same text widths
# in every style
theme file apps/gallery/fixtures/inter.theme
expect theme "Inter"
expect text:"Wert: 40 %   Klicks: 0" rect * * 143 *
shot build/gal_themes/inter_light.png
theme dark
shot build/gal_themes/inter_dark.png
theme light
# ---- broken files: the error names the line or the file, the theme stays
theme file apps/themedemo/tests/fixtures/broken.theme
expect theme error "Zeile 5: „#12345“ ist keine Farbe"
expect theme "Inter"
theme file apps/themedemo/tests/fixtures/nofont.theme
expect theme error "Schrift nicht ladbar"
expect theme "Inter"
# ---- back to the style's own look: the same pixels as before any theme
theme none
expect theme none
expect same build/gal_themes/default.png
